        "kind": "lemma",
        "title": "Euler–Maruyama one-step moment and increment estimates",
        "strategy": "Use finite Gaussian p-moments and a second-order Taylor estimate for x ↦ |x|^p to bound one recursion step conditionally; use conditional centering and covariance for the interpolation increment.",
