        "title": "Euler–Maruyama uniform moments and interpolation increments",
        "strategy": "Prove one-step integrability and adaptedness by induction, iterate the conditional p-moment recursion with (1+Ch)^k ≤ exp(Ckh), then apply the p=2 increment estimate within each grid interval.",
